    euclideanDyadicCubeShellMass 2 law shell *
        selectedShellGeometricCompactBudget 2 count law
          (selectedShellGeometricEffectiveDepth 2 count law confidence) confidence shell ≤
      ENNReal.ofReal (euclideanDyadicCubeRadius shell) * ENNReal.ofReal
        ((32 * Real.sqrt 2 +
            4 * (selectedShellGeometricEffectiveDepth 2 count law confidence shell) +
